225:### Table 3: Evaluation Results
227:The data from table 3 was obtained by running ScType against the entire dataset: 
240:The expected results of ScType run against the projects in the dataset are recorded in the files in this directory. Specifically, each of the 29 projects has a file corresponding to the expected results from running ScType on it. The index of the project on Table 3 of the paper corresponds to the index of the file in this directory. For example, MarginSwap is the 1st project in the table, and its expected results are located in results1.md.
